WEBVTT

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:11.990
Ritual of the Great Star Ward?

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:15.360
The Star Ward offered to the thirteenth phantom,

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.230
the last remaining Impurity, 
is the Great Star Ward.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:22.620
This ward is the Visitor, Itsuki, himself.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:25.880
Hold on! What will happen to Itsuki, then?

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:29.740
He will be sealed together 
with the thirteenth phantom,

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:31.800
for all eternity.

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:33.050
How can that be?

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:35.150
And you're telling us to perform that ritual?

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:36.300
Are you serious?

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.970
Granvania will be doomed unless you do.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:44.780
Itsuki has accepted becoming 
the Great Star Ward.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:46.850
This is also what he wants.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.440
That can't be...

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:51.320
Itsuki!

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.900
About the Ritual of the Great Star Ward...

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:56.140
I'm gonna have to pass.

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:57.920
Why the sudden change of heart?

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:01.870
It's because he now has 
something really special!

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:03.240
Right, Ikkun?

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:04.330
Ikkun?

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:05.850
Huh?

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:08.080
They're getting along strangely well.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:09.710
Did something happen?

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:11.460
They've done it, for sure.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:13.840
That's why she's acting like a girlfriend.

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:17.090
I want to fight to the end.

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:19.000
You have my support.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.710
Thank you, Alfie.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.980
You have me, so you'll be fine!

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:39.920
I'm impressed that you made up 
your mind to fight the phantom.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:43.240
If I sacrificed myself, 
Granvania would be saved.

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:45.850
That would be the safe choice.

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:46.500
But...

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:51.260
I want to live longer.

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:56.170
Yes! We have a happy life and a 
happy home waiting for us!

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.160
Huh?

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:59.230
Right...

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:01.530
I have to fight hard for my future.

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:03.180
Why did you come with me, Mana?

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:06.490
Oh, come on! Do you even have to ask?

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:07.390
You're so silly!

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:09.050
When I was given such a passionate embrace,

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:13.320
the ladybug within me came out
 and started dancing samba!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.780
Ladybug?

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:17.070
We're already two as one.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:20.200
If you're going, then I'll follow 
you to the ends of the earth!

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.790
I see. Thank you, Mana.

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:25.200
Ooh...

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.480
Those words went right through my uterus!

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:31.540
I'm all yours now.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:35.210
My heart and soul belong to you, Ikkun!

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:42.480
I can feel it from here.

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:45.720
Yeah, I can feel it pulsing through me, too!

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.810
The thirteenth phantom!

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:57.690
I'll defeat you, and live in the future!

00:02:58.310 --> 00:02:59.030
What?!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.580
Ikkun!

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:07.080
I'm all right.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:07.950
Ikkun...

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.290
Is Visitor-sama going to be all right?

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:15.370
Maybe we should've gone with him.

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:16.920
Should we go after him?

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:17.690
Yeah!

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:19.970
No, we have instructions from Itsuki-san.

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:23.220
Please protect everyone, guys.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.970
Alfie, please take care of the kids.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:28.600
Yes, please leave it to me!

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:32.040
The woman I love the most, Alfie.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.860
Take care of the proof of our love,

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:35.610
he said!

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:37.820
He didn't say that, did he?

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.910
My mom is Reone, not Alfie.

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:42.890
I'm Femiruna's child.

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:44.280
Mahiru is my mom.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.090
Don't worry about the details!

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:48.120
You have to capture the true meaning.

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:51.400
This must be what housewives feel

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.370
while waiting for their 
husbands to come home!

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:56.400
A housewife is someone who cheats?

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:00.080
They seduce their husband's boss,
 and neighbors, and stuff?

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:02.880
Alfie is a housewife, so she's a seductress?

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.160
Housewives do not cheat on their husbands!

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.600
Who taught you something so ridiculous?

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:10.200
The raccoon who was acting like a lover!

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:11.600
Sparkle!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:14.100
She needs to get exorcised 
when she gets back.

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:17.110
There's not much time remaining.

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:18.400
Yes.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:21.110
We must begin the Ritual of the
Great Star Ward right away.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.610
But...

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:26.250
If you don't, this world will 
be filled with Impurities

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:31.100
and you will not be able to 
return to your home in Sola!

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:35.620
Mahiru.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:52.720
We, the powers that 
transcend time and space,

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:55.140
hereby terminate the path of chaos.

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:01.130
Damn it, my attacks aren't 
even scratching it!

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:05.080
Let's run, and live somewhere quiet together!

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:07.200
I can't do that.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.240
I have to stop it, no matter what it takes.

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:09.830
What's this?

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.080
Could it be the Ritual of the Great Star Ward?

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:19.680
Light is now filled.

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:21.840
Darkness now be eliminated.

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.340
Ikkun! No! No!

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.120
I command the law of the universe.

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:29.160
Turn this soul into the Great Star Ward,

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.850
and send the chaos into eternal sleep...

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.380
Sleep...

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:36.620
What's wrong?

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:38.150
Continue with the ritual!

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:39.860
I can't do this!

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.860
I can't sacrifice Itsuki!

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:48.360
Ikkun!

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:49.740
What happened?

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.700
The ritual was stopped!

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.900
Ikkun!

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.500
You couldn't do it, after all?

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:06.260
I'm sorry, but I don't 
want to sacrifice Itsuki!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.720
Is there any other way?

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:12.680
Even if the world is saved, 
it's pointless if Itsuki is gone!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.830
Well, Narcisstes?

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:16.200
There may be one way...

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:16.930
Mirei.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:20.310
While I was going through 
the documents in the castle,

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:24.010
I discovered in an ancient document 
inside the library which said...

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:28.640
"If the Visitor is able to truly 
bond with all the maidens,"

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:31.450
"the power to rid the world of 
Impurities can be obtained."

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:37.020
There wasn't any more detail 
 in the document.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:39.160
It is close to a hopeless dream.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:43.460
But we may not have to sacrifice 
Itsuki if we are able to do that.

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:45.640
It's too much of a gamble.

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:47.770
But we have to give it a try.

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:51.070
Maidens, please help out Itsuki

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:53.470
and save this world!

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:57.420
Yes, thank you!

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:58.480
Let's go, everybody!

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:02.570
Are you sure about this?

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:06.480
I share their desire not to sacrifice the Visitor.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.280
What's going on?

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.560
Get ready, everyone!

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:13.600
The presence of a powerful Impurity...

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:14.240
It's coming!

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:30.010
That's the thirteenth phantom.

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:34.390
This thing came out, 
so that means Itsuki-san is...

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.300
It's our turn.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.390
We have our instructions from Visitor-sama.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:41.890
We'll protect this country from them!

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:44.400
I-I...

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:46.920
You protect Alfie.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:49.210
We'll defeat that thing.

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:50.400
He's right.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:52.650
You guys...

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:55.490
Please let us help, too.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:59.610
We cherish Granvania just as much.

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:02.170
We won't sacrifice Itsuki.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.170
We're here to support him!

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:26.690
The maidens' and Star Childrens' 
powers have synchronized.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:49.670
Mana!

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:51.670
You saved me!

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:55.790
This is... a piece of cake.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:58.270
The Ritual of the Great Star Ward failed?

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.680
The maidens must have stopped it.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:02.650
Mahiru and the others?

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:07.240
Then what should we do 
about the thirteenth phantom?

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:09.770
There's only one thing to do.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.570
You have to defeat it.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:19.160
I won't tell you to save Granvania, but...

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:22.280
please fight for the people 
you want to protect.

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:23.580
Mana...

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:27.160
This is the last thing I can do for you.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.330
The last thing? Don't say that!

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:31.210
<b>Red Softshell 
Turtle Juice</b>

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:37.160
Oops!

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:42.720
This is what I was saving to invigorate 
you for our first night together!

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:45.420
I "borrowed" this from Shangri-La.

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:47.230
It's to save the world!

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.230
I can always count on you, Mana.

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:52.230
Behind every great man,
 there's a great woman.

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:55.740
All right, let's go!

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.160
No, this isn't working at all!

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.240
What's with this guy?

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:04.450
No fair!

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.170
Itsuki!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.170
Itsuki-san!

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:18.930
Are you all right?

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.680
That's our line!

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:23.450
You made up your mind about the
 Great Star Ward and stuff all on your own!

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.940
What were you thinking?

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:27.630
I'm so sorry.

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:31.290
But I don't want to become 
the Great Star Ward.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:33.400
I want to be with all of you!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.440
Wanna do it with you all!

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:41.100
W-Well, looks like you feel bad 
about it, so I'll forgive you...

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:42.450
Right?

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:52.430
We'll just have to defeat 
the thirteenth phantom now.

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:54.380
Everyone, please lend me your strength!

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:10.220
I won't let you do it!

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:11.390
We will...

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:13.450
protect the maidens!

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:20.320
Itsuki!

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:40.220
I'm glad... I was able to protect you.

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:48.970
Get yourself together, Alfie!

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:52.040
I'm glad that I was able to protect you.

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:55.900
Now I've fulfilled my duty as a Star Child.

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:57.550
It's nothing to be glad about!

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.150
We'll heal your wound.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:01.240
Mana, give me more of the potion you gave me!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.660
I'm sorry, Alfie is already...

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.960
What do you mean? Just give me more!

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:08.010
No...

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:09.560
Don't.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:12.910
Don't worry about me.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:19.840
I'm sure this is what I've been living for.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.980
I was born as a Star Child,

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:23.980
became a maiden,

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:28.330
and I was able to protect you, Itsuki-san.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.930
This is too much happiness for me.

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.600
How can this be happiness?!

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:35.330
There's... There's so much more...

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.690
This is only a start for us!

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:38.360
Itsuki-san...

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:43.260
Then make me happier.

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:02.300
You really did it.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:06.680
This is the happiest I could possibly be.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:07.930
Alfie...

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:14.260
Itsuki-san, you taught me 
what it feels like to be in love.

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:17.000
Thank you...

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:33.720
No way!

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:34.780
Alfie-san!

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:35.710
Alfie!

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:42.010
Thirteenth phantom...

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:45.850
I'll never forgive you!

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:52.270
The emblem of Ophiuchus.

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:53.540
Alfie...

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:57.340
You were thinking about 
Itsuki to the very end.

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:00.760
I want to be of help to Itsuki, too!

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.910
We're with you, too!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.660
We'll fight together!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.660
I'll help out to the end!

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.910
Hurry and beat that thing!

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:17.410
I don't want it to destroy everything!

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:20.420
I'll do anything to prevent that!

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.170
Let's kick its ass!

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:26.920
I also... want to... protect animals...

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:29.930
I won't be able to travel 
if the world is destroyed!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.680
Nor bake bread!

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:34.180
I won't be able to draw...

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:36.680
We all love this country.

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:42.070
Accept all our feelings!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.910
Combine!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:13.300
The Visitor, maidens, and the proof 
of their love, the Star Children, became one!

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:15.930
That is the power to defeat the Impurity!

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:17.930
Itsuki! Go for it!

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:19.940
Combined Mecha Beam!

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:28.820
That's the true form of the thirteenth phantom!

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:31.450
How unsightly!

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:36.200
Visitor, why do you reject me?

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:39.700
The phantom... spoke?

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:44.560
Answer me. Why do you reject me?

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.760
Because you're an Impurity!

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:48.040
That's right.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:52.720
I am an Impurity. The destroyer 
of everything in this world.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:57.240
However, you humans created me.

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:58.220
Shut up!

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:01.200
The act of love by humans...

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:05.520
It is also the act of defiling 
others with your own hands.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:08.860
That is me, Impurity!

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:12.990
Itsuki!

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:16.490
Visitor, I want to see you struggle.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.140
Fear not.

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:29.340
You must have also felt joy
 and comfort in defiling others...

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:32.550
when you defiled the maidens over there!

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:42.250
Come, accept me.

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:47.610
Become one with me, 
and defile every corner of this world!

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:53.620
Come, hurry and accept me!

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:58.990
Like hell!

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:04.190
You may be right that loving 
someone means to defile them.

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:06.000
But that's not all!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:11.250
Because I came to like them.... because 
I loved them, the Star Children were born!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.920
If humans' love gives birth to Impurities,

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:18.880
then Star Children are born 
as hope to get rid of them!

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:20.730
That's what Alfie

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:23.100
and everyone taught me!

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:27.810
Itsuki...

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:33.700
Alfie...

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:49.530
Rasaru!

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:27.910
Visitor-sama, leave the rest to us.

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:30.170
This is our duty.

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:38.090
Thank you for giving birth to me.

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:43.830
Visitor-sama, thank you 
for giving birth to us!

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:49.230
Bye-bye!

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:50.730
<i>You guys...</i>

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:16.250
Are you having a hard 
time deciding what to do?

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:18.760
Yeah.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.920
I'm not surprised.

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:23.560
I'm going back, though.

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:27.360
I want to see Dad and Mom,

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:29.730
and the other world is where I belong.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:33.410
Although, it's sad to leave everyone.

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:34.980
You should do what you want.

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:37.900
There must be reasons for 
you to want to remain here.

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:40.020
Mahiru.

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:42.360
I'm going back, too.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:43.990
Are you sure?

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:45.060
Yeah.

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:48.630
I've already fulfilled my duty.

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:04.470
Sorry. We've decided to return home.

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:06.490
You guys found out.

00:20:09.590 --> 00:20:12.120
This is what you two have decided.

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:14.970
We'll see you off with a smile.

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:17.980
It's unfortunate, but 
I don't blame you for it.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:21.690
I wanted to research more about 
the existence of Visitors.

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:25.240
Well... Take care of yourselves.

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:28.700
But maybe I'll see you again in my journey!

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:31.000
That's not very likely...

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:34.000
I guess we'll never meet again.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:37.050
Bye-bye... It was fun.

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:41.160
This is a letter from everyone.

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:44.040
I drew a picture. Please take it with you.

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:47.020
This is freshly baked 
bread. Please try it!

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:51.980
Y-You guys... uh...

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:54.500
Bleh! Bleh! Bleh!

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:57.580
Thank you so much, everyone!

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:58.630
See you!

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:07.410
I don't want to say goodbye!

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:08.410
Me, too!

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:09.470
Me, too!

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:11.620
I don't want goodbye, either!

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:13.310
Wait, everybody!

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:15.160
Let's open a bakery together!

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:17.190
We can form a comedic trio!

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:19.150
Bleh! Bleh! Bleh!

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:21.300
That's cheating, you guys!

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:23.870
Let me research you a bit more!

00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:26.300
I want you to be the model for my paintings!

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:32.090
Then, me, too!

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:33.380
Me, too!

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:39.060
<i>Was that...</i>

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:51.610
Ow...

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:53.740
You're all here?!

00:21:56.190 --> 00:21:58.350
The gate closed...

00:21:58.350 --> 00:21:59.950
There's no returning for us.

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:02.010
Things will work out!

00:22:02.010 --> 00:22:03.560
Yeah, yeah!

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:06.340
Alfie?!

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:09.590
And all the Star Children, too!

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:10.910
How?

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:13.500
Looks like we were revived, somehow!

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:15.400
Yeah!

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:17.370
Also, who's that?!

00:22:17.370 --> 00:22:18.380
It's Mana.

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:20.100
What?!

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:25.020
I was showered with all your love, 
and the woman within me was awakened!

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:27.640
You laid your hands on a raccoon, too?!

00:22:27.640 --> 00:22:29.630
What do you mean, "too"?

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:31.930
I didn't lay my hands on anyone!

00:22:31.930 --> 00:22:35.980
I got a kiss from him!

00:22:37.400 --> 00:22:39.150
Oh, that's right...

00:22:39.150 --> 00:22:43.130
No, more to the point...
 What will we do now?!

00:22:43.610 --> 00:22:45.190
There's no choice,

00:22:45.810 --> 00:22:47.240
I guess...

00:22:47.780 --> 00:22:49.130
Wanna come my house?

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:51.530
Yeah!

00:23:25.910 --> 00:23:26.920
Everyone...

00:23:34.740 --> 00:23:36.850
Give birth to my child...

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:38.810
Yes!

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Give Birth to My Child!</b>
